{
  "version": 2,
  "scope": "US-GAAP consolidated entity facts. Dimensions, custom tags, IFRS and segment facts require separate mappings. Missing is never zero.",
  "tag_policy": "Ordered explicit tags only, with documented profile/CIK overrides. Unequal alternatives within the same filing and period are flagged. A conflicted input emits a flagged derived vintage to invalidate older clean subtractions; default queries exclude it. Semantically different scopes are separate metrics.",
  "period_policy": "Inclusive dates classify durations, allowing 16/17-week retailer quarters. Twelve-month figures in annual forms are annual; twelve-month values from quarterly forms are reported_12m, not presumed fiscal-year totals. SEC fy/fp remain filing labels only.",
  "availability_policy": "available_at is filed date plus one day at America/New_York midnight converted to UTC. acceptance_at is separate evidence; no claim of exact public availability.",
  "units_policy": "USD, shares or USD/shares only as specified per metric. Other units remain available in raw facts.",
  "derivation_policy": "Additive flows only. Same fiscal start, source tag and unit; adjacent cumulative periods. All input vintages retained. Cross-filing differences are explicitly unverified.",
